OL,3,GNEWSAFirst year student film scoops
OL,4,Ainternational awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FA first-year university student has
OL,7,Fcelebrated international success with a
OL,8,Fshort film about a young vampire.
OL,10,FHemophobia was written and directed by
OL,11,FTommy Balmont while he was studying for
OL,12,Fa BA in film production at Arts
OL,13,FUniversity Bournemouth (AUB).
OL,15,FThe short film premiered in June, going
OL,16,Fon to win Best Student Film at the
OL,17,FLondon Independent Film Awards and the
OL,18,FNew York Film and Actress Awards.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
